# Keeps public/uploads/ present in the repo so runtime uploads have a target
# directory on a fresh clone or deploy. Uploaded files live here but are
# gitignored (see .gitignore) — they are per-server data, not source.
#
# Files are written by src/lib/storage/local-storage.ts under
# public/uploads/<kind>/ (avatars, portfolio) and served by Next.js at
# /uploads/<kind>/<file>. Override the location with UPLOAD_DIR.
